[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙深深地吐了一口气。|#0104Adv02_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙……|#0104Adv02_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_24_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:还没被抓到这里来的时候，我就离家出走了。<br>我一直没有回家。|#0104Adv02_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经回不了家了。|#0104Adv02_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:至于我爸妈，我只希望他们能把我忘了，<br>幸福地过日子就好。|#0104Adv02_Alisa009| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:反正我会被关在这里，<br>直到变成魔女，然后死去吧。|#0104Adv02_Alisa010| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（怎么会这样，果然到最后我会孤零零一个人……）|#0104Adv02_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在下雪的湖边呆太久，<br>艾玛感觉全身都冷透了。|#0104Adv02_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她抱着身体直打寒颤。<br>就在下一瞬间，身旁突然冒出一股暖意。|#0104Adv02_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 炎をぼっと点す音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_30 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,ArmL11,Angle01/Option_ArmL+

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，谢谢你，亚里沙……真暖和。|#0104Adv02_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:发现原来是亚里沙为了自己在指尖点起火焰后，<br>艾玛绽开了笑容。|#0104Adv02_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,ArmL11,Angle01/Option_ArmL+

[PrintTextModified Text:我能做的就这么点事。<br>……啊，可是最近我能让火焰的温度升得相当高哦。|#0104Adv02_Alisa011| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——高得可以融化任何东西。|#0104Adv02_Alisa012| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:你的意思是……|#0104Adv02_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是我的魔女化程度在加深，所以魔法变得更强了吧。|#0104Adv02_Alisa013| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:轻轻的一句嘟哝，<br>语气却那么地死气沉沉。|#0104Adv02_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,ArmL11,Angle01/Option_ArmL+

[PrintTextModified Text:唔，忍不住了——|#0104Adv02_Alisa014| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

