[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙突然弯下身，<br>捂住胸口痛苦地呻吟起来。|#0104Adv02_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙！？<br>你还好吗，亚里沙！？|#0104Adv02_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛靠近亚里沙，伸手想要触碰亚里沙的肩膀。<br>就在她触碰到对方之前，一只手伸了过来……|#0104Adv02_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（欸——）|#0104Adv02_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

